    "zh": "白发的幼年体大肥龙娘,身高约五个半头,以三分之四视角朝右站立;两只冰蓝色龙角、精灵尖耳、鬓边白玫瑰和蓝色花饰,浅蓝色眼睛半眯着;白色露肩荷叶边连衣裙,蓝色腰带与蝴蝶结,前口袋里插着笔;身后有蓝鳞龙尾,光腿,穿白色玫瑰毛绒拖鞋;坐下时双手放在膝上,裙摆铺开",
    "en": "a white-haired young dragon girl, about five and a half heads tall, standing in a three-quarter view facing right; two ice-blue horns, pointed ears, a white rose and blue flower hair clip, half-lidded pale blue eyes; a white off-shoulder ruffled dress with blue ribbons and bows, pens in the front pocket, a blue-scaled tail, bare legs and white fluffy rose slippers; when sitting, her hands rest on her knees and her skirt spreads out"
  },
